# ⛔ EVERY .env VARIANT, because the patterns kept missing new ones. `.env`, `.env.preview` and
# `.env*.local` did NOT match `.env copy` (a Finder duplicate, which reached origin/main of this
# PUBLIC repo carrying a live mnemonic and Blockfrost key) and did NOT match `.envPreview` either.
# Two different near-misses of the same shape is enough: match the prefix, and keep examples
# explicitly.
.env*
!.env*.example
!.env*Example
